{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"document\">这一刻，音乐仿佛忽然透进了清亮的空气，连呼吸也变得宽阔起来。旋律舒展地唱着，带着近乎牧歌般的朴素与温柔，清澈、淡雅，似乎不再急于靠近谁。可是，这份明净并不意味着内心已经安宁。歌声像隔着一层薄薄的纱，柔软而略显遥远，明亮中有一丝迟疑，平静里藏着不易察觉的颤动。每一句都唱得自然，却又像在悄悄收住自己的声音，不愿让情绪完全流露。有些话仿佛已经来到唇边，最终仍化作轻轻的吟唱。越是这样从容，越能感到那份未曾平息的心绪，在清澈的表面之下缓缓荡漾。此刻的温柔，因这份克制而格外动人。</", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-8d2d497cb34a4c6cbe5d1a624a19a23e", "response_sha256": "27b230aa2e906aefb3a8ea9e34e95873a0d6082fb5e7ce45c45cd45e68b9a2d8", "session_handle": "77b0cdab-e0eb-467a-aa67-0d7c9f87579b", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 1.003, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 7.308}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 171, "first_assistant_seconds": 13.203, "first_text_seconds": 25.906, "stream_seconds": 34.969, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 162}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observations": [], "